043489"},{"term":"Allô ? T'es toujours là ?","back":"Hello? Are you still here?","register":"casual","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/3702"},{"term":"Bonjour, il y a quelqu'un ?","back":"Hello, is there anybody there?","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/11928327"},{"term":"Comment vas-tuyau de poêle ?","back":"What's up, dawg?","register":"casual","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/788862"},{"term":"Coucou, y a-t-il quelqu'un ?","back":"Hello? Anyone there?","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/1445232"},{"term":"As-tu deviné d'où je viens ?","back":"Did you guess where I'm from?","scene":"introducing yourself","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/3932110"},{"term":"Bonjour, puis-je vous aider ?","back":"Hello, can I help you?","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/5971959"},{"term":"Merci pour cet accueil cordial.","back":"Thank you for the warm welcome.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/9543655"},{"term":"Au fait, comment tu t'appelles ?","back":"What's your name, by the way?","scene":"introducing yourself","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/11928347"},{"term":"Je te verrai plus tard, d'accord ?","back":"I'll see you later, OK?","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/5381243"},{"term":"Bonjour. Comment puis-je vous aider ?","back":"Hello. How can I help you?","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/11764563"},{"term":"Comment as-tu pu partir sans dire au revoir ?","back":"How could you just leave without saying goodbye?","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/11037585"},{"term":"Quel accueil chaleureux ! Comment ai-je mérité ça ?","back":"What a warm welcome! How did I deserve this?","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/6923855"},{"term":"Re-bonjour.","back":"Hello again.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8292453"},{"term":"Dis au revoir.","back":"Say goodbye.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/6463385"},{"term":"Je suis d'ici.","back":"I'm from here.","scene":"introducing yourself","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8332333"},{"term":"À demain au bureau.","back":"See you tomorrow in the office.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/333860"},{"term":"Au fait, d'où es-tu ?","back":"By the way, where are you from?","scene":"introducing yourself","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/15121"},{"term":"« Allô, c'est qui ? »","back":"\"Hello, who is this?\"","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/409198"},{"term":"Allons-y dire bonjour.","back":"Let's go and say hello.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8218047"},{"term":"Je dois dire au revoir.","back":"I need to say goodbye.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/7157360"},{"term":"Dites au revoir à vos amis.","back":"Say goodbye to your friends.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/135482"},{"term":"Je vais au lit. Bonne nuit.","back":"I'm going to bed. Good night.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8107369"},{"term":"C'est une agréable nouvelle.","back":"That's welcome news.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/5226774"},{"term":"Tu n'es plus le bienvenu ici.","back":"You're no longer welcome here.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/1800245"},{"term":"N'oublie pas de dire au revoir.","back":"Don't forget to say goodbye.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/12355045"},{"term":"Je viens d'un clan de lutteurs.","back":"I'm from a clan of fighters.","scene":"introducing yourself","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14024765"},{"term":"Ne sors pas sans dire au revoir.","back":"Don't leave without saying goodbye.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/11637"},{"term":"Je voulais juste dire au revoir.","back":"I just wanted to say goodbye.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2252313"},{"term":"Tu ne m'as même pas dit bonjour !","back":"You didn't even say \"hello\" to me!","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/6681897"},{"term":"J'imagine que c'est un au revoir.","back":"I guess this is goodbye.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/6454481"},{"term":"Tu n'es plus le bienvenu chez moi.","back":"You're no longer welcome in my house.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/6812860"},{"term":"Ma petite sœur n'a pas dit bonjour.","back":"My younger sister didn't say \"hello.\"","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/5353305"},{"term":"Bonjour, c'est le service de chambre.","back":"Hello, this is room service.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8954176"},{"term":"Salut ! Je suis un nouvel utilisateur.","back":"Hello! I'm a new user.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/1623767"},{"term":"J'ignore comment dire au revoir en français.","back":"I don't know how to say goodbye in French.","scene":"greeting","src":"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2504279"}]}